[ar:ARK Music]
[ti:Breakin' to live!]
[al:Problem's]

[00:03.23]Red light on the window,
[00:04.83]Shoes beside the door,
[00:06.85]Somebody said “tomorrow,”
[00:09.11]Like they’d said it all before.
[00:11.01]Clock keeps cutting circles,
[00:13.21]Feet keep finding time,
[00:15.55]Smile like nothing happened,
[00:17.35]Leave the heavy part behind.
[00:28.41]Morning wears a white shirt,
[00:30.42]Night forgets your name,
[00:32.06]Everybody's moving,
[00:34.17]Nobody asks the same.
[00:36.26]Hands are getting colder,
[00:38.30]Eyes are getting bright,
[00:40.49]Everybody says you're lucky
[00:42.55]When you make it through the night.
[00:44.98]And you laugh, laugh, laugh
[00:47.31]When the room gets loud,
[00:48.30]Stand, stand, stand
[00:49.30]When they call you proud,
[00:50.45]But somewhere underneath the sound,
[00:52.50]There's a door that won't come back around.
[00:54.81]Breakin' to live,
[00:55.44]Livin' to breathe,
[00:56.56]Carry the pieces
[00:57.74]Nobody sees.
[00:58.83]Run with the rhythm,
[00:59.72]Dance with the ache,
[01:00.69]Give what you have
[01:01.77]Till there's nothing to fake.
[01:02.84]Breakin' to live,
[01:03.80]Shinin' somehow,
[01:04.87]Yesterday's shadow
[01:05.84]Can't hold you now.
[01:07.00]If you know, you know,
[01:07.92]If you don't, let it be,
[01:08.98]Some roads disappear
[01:10.18]So the heart can be free.
[01:11.83]Hey!
[01:12.41]Keep it moving, keep it moving,
[01:16.36]Hey!
[01:17.47]Even when the floor gives way.
[01:20.71]Hey!
[01:22.59]Keep it moving, keep it moving,
[01:24.69]One more breath,
[01:26.60]One more day.
[01:31.79]School bells, train lines,
[01:33.32]Deadlines in disguise,
[01:35.26]Little gold stars waiting
[01:37.08]For the tired behind the eyes.
[01:39.71]“Be somebody.”
[01:40.56]“Don't fall behind.”
[01:43.11]“Everybody's winning.”
[01:44.50]Nobody checks the finish line.
[01:47.46]A photograph keeps smiling
[01:49.60]From a year we can't replay,
[01:51.51]Somebody in the picture
[01:53.56]Never made it to today.
[01:56.32]So we laugh, laugh, laugh
[01:58.49]With the music high,
[01:59.35]Move, move, move
[02:00.38]While the hours fly.
[02:01.64]And if the morning asks your name,
[02:03.31]Give it something bright,
[02:05.11]You don't owe the world
[02:07.20]The story of the night.
[02:09.46]Breakin' to live,
[02:10.84]Livin' to breathe,
[02:11.86]Carry the pieces
[02:12.91]Nobody sees.
[02:14.04]Run with the rhythm,
[02:15.27]Dance with the ache,
[02:16.02]Give what you have
[02:17.05]Till there's nothing to fake.
[02:18.15]Breakin' to live,
[02:19.11]Shinin' somehow,
[02:20.34]Yesterday's shadow
[02:21.25]Can't hold you now.
[02:22.33]If you know, you know,
[02:23.20]If you don't, let it be,
[02:24.33]Some roads disappear
[02:25.50]So the heart can be free.
[02:27.43]Don't call it weakness
[02:28.82]When the walls bend low,
[02:31.37]Don't call it failure
[02:33.13]When the old lights go.
[02:35.54]Somebody leaves quietly,
[02:37.71]Somebody stays too long,
[02:39.90]Somebody learns the hard way
[02:41.66]How to turn pain into song.
[02:43.92]And maybe that's the secret,
[02:46.09]Maybe that's the sign:
[02:47.84]You weren't made of stone.
[02:49.81]You were making it through time.
[02:59.61]Breakin' to live,
[03:00.76]Livin' to breathe,
[03:01.79]Carry the pieces
[03:02.96]Nobody sees.
[03:04.22]Run with the rhythm,
[03:05.03]Dance with the ache,
[03:06.06]Love what is left
[03:07.02]Of the life you can make.
[03:08.76]Breakin' to live,
[03:09.69]Shinin' somehow,
[03:10.20]Hands in the air
[03:11.02]Though the sky fell down.
[03:12.56]If you know, you know,
[03:13.71]No explanation needed,
[03:15.60]Some hearts keep dancing
[03:18.25]Long after they're leaving.
[03:28.35]Red light in the window,
[03:32.26]Shoes beside the door...
[03:34.07]The room keeps moving.
[03:36.27]But not everybody does.
[03:44.32]Keep moving.